# 01: Expose parser warning count

**Blocked by:** None
**Status:** open

## Delivery

Parser diagnostics report the number of warnings without changing existing diagnostic entries.

## Design context

The [warning-count behavior](../requirements.md#warning-count-behavior) extends the approved [parser result ownership](../design.md#parser-result-seam).

## Touch points

Parser result type and its diagnostics behavior tests.

## Changes

1. Add the derived warning count to the existing result.
2. Project the count beside current diagnostics.

## Constraints

Existing diagnostic ordering and contents remain unchanged.

## Done and verify

The parser result exposes the count and existing diagnostics remain stable; run `go test ./internal/tracker/...`.
